WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.000
APIs power literally every app you use every day.

2
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.000
But most people have no idea what they actually are.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
The word API stands for Application Programming Interface.

4
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:29.667
Simplest way to understand it? A restaurant analogy.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.333
YOU = the app. KITCHEN = the data. API = the waiter in between.

6
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:47.333
You send a request. The API delivers it. The response comes back.

7
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:59.333
Log in with Google? That's an API. Pay with Stripe? That's an API.

8
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:04.667
Without APIs, every app would have to build everything from scratch.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn full stack development at 0xverse Academy.

